# SUN (Symbolic Universal Notation) symbol pronunciations for NVDA.
# Generated October 16, 2026 from the published SUN New Testament aligned to the English ULB.
# Glosses are INFERRED statistically, not confirmed by Wycliffe Associates. Confidence noted per line.
# Install: copy the lines into %APPDATA%\nvda\symbols-en.dic (your user symbol dictionary) and restart NVDA,
# or add single-symbol lines through Preferences, Punctuation/symbol pronunciation. Multi-symbol words use complexSymbols.

